        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Green Hornet (TV series)\n- People: Van Williams, Bruce Lee, Keye Luke\n- Characters: Kato, Green Hornet, Britt Reid\n- Companies: ABC\n\nFacts:\n- The Green Hornet is a television series that aired on the ABC US television network during the 1966–1967 TV season.\n- Van Williams starred in The Green Hornet television series as the Green Hornet, also known as Britt Reid.\n- Kato is a fictional character from The Green Hornet series.\n- In The Green Hornet television series, Bruce Lee portrayed Kato.\n- In The Green Hornet movie serials, Keye Luke played Kato.",
